Subject: [PATCH 0902/3799] soh: rename D_8098786C -> sShadowMedallionCs

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: CutsceneData script installed into csCtx.segment by the chamberCutsceneNum == 4 branch that awards ITEM_MEDALLION_SHADOW.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im_cutscene_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c               | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im_cutscene_data.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
index 31298e4df..17305b885 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
@@ -334,7 +334,7 @@ void func_8098544C(DemoIm* this, PlayState* play) {
         Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
 
         this->action = 1;
-        play->csCtx.segment = D_8098786C;
+        play->csCtx.segment = sShadowMedallionCs;  // was D_8098786C [LLM:HIGH]
         gSaveContext.cutsceneTrigger = 2;
         if (GameInteractor_Should(VB_GIVE_ITEM_SHADOW_MEDALLION, true)) {
             Item_Give(play, ITEM_MEDALLION_SHADOW);
diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im_cutscene_data.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im_cutscene_data.c
